                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "In May, I requested $2M in federal funding for Refuah Health to build a medical center in Sullivan County.\n\nToday, I was honored to visit the site and discuss our progress. \n\nRural health providers are under attack like never before. I won't let Upstate New York fall behind. https://t.co/qgLRjUzAJ3",
