                "text": "Operation \"Healthy Broome\" is up and running!\n\nOur heroes at the Army, Air Force, and Navy are delivering free healthcare services\u2013including child physicals and medical screenings\u2013to Upstate families at the SUNY Broome Ice Center until August 20th. \n\nLearn more below \u2b07\ufe0f",
